<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41520" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rē^-trĭbŭo</span></b> ,
			ŭi, ūtum, 3, v. a.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to give
			back</i>, <i>return</i>, <i>restore</i>, <i>repay</i> (class., but freq. only in
			eccl. Lat.; syn. remuneror). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpora retribuat rebus recreetque fluentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 275</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">populo pecuniam acceptam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					2, 41, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fructum quem meruerunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Rosc. Com. 15, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliena suis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Paul. Nol. Carm. 32, 514</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quodcunque aliud acceperis, potes cum libuit
					retribuere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 332, 24</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vicem alicui,</span>”
				<i>to repay</i>, <i>requite</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 6, 18, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">retributionem gentibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 1
					Macc. 2, 68</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">justis bona,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Prov. 13, 21</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
